-- run left in _G, so a session that ended on "Always" came back as "Always" while the
-- dropdown drew "Hold". Same trap as the map's own-dot toggle. Always is a debugging
-- mode - left on by accident it dashes you at anything within chase range, walls
-- included - so it has to be chosen deliberately every time.
